#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:1
msgid "Reproducibility and Checkpointing"
msgstr "再現性とチェックポイント"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:3
msgid ""
"Makes long-running optimizations reproducible and lets you resume them "
"partway through."
msgstr "長時間実行する最適化を再現可能にし、途中から再開できるようにします。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:5
msgid "Checkpointing is only available with the low-level `Optimizer` API."
msgstr "チェックポイント機能は低レベルAPIの`Optimizer`でのみ使えます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:7
msgid ""
"See the low-level API section of [Single-Objective "
"Optimization](single_objective.md) for how to assemble an `Optimizer`."
msgstr "`Optimizer`の組み立て方は[単目的最適化](single_objective.md)の低レベルAPI節を参照してください。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:9
msgid "Reproducibility via random seed"
msgstr "乱数シードによる再現性"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:11
msgid ""
"Passing the same `seed` to `Optimizer(problem, seed=...)` initializes all"
" random-number-using processes in the same sequence, producing identical "
"results."
msgstr "`Optimizer(problem, seed=...)`に同じ`seed`を渡すと、乱数を使う処理が同じ手順で初期化され、同一の結果が得られます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:79
msgid ""
"`build_optimizer` is used in the following sections too, to rebuild an "
"`Optimizer` with the same component configuration."
msgstr "`build_optimizer`は、以降の節でも同じコンポーネント構成のまま`Optimizer`を作り直すために使います。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:81
msgid "Saving and resuming a checkpoint"
msgstr "チェックポイントの保存と再開"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:83
msgid ""
"The `ctx` returned by `run()` can be saved to a single npz file with "
"`ctx.save(path)`."
msgstr "`run()`が返す`ctx`は、`ctx.save(path)`でnpz形式の単一ファイルに保存できます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:90
msgid ""
"A saved checkpoint can be loaded with `OptimizationState.load(path, "
"problem)`, and passing it to `Optimizer.run_from(ctx)` resumes from where"
" it left off."
msgstr "保存したチェックポイントは`OptimizationState.load(path, problem)`で読み込み、`Optimizer.run_from(ctx)`に渡すと続きから再開できます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:102
msgid ""
"`ctx.data[\"resumed\"]` is a flag set to `True` only on a context resumed"
" via `run_from()`."
msgstr "`ctx.data[\"resumed\"]`は、`run_from()`で再開したコンテキストにだけ`True`が設定されるフラグです。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:104
msgid ""
"From a callback such as `RunStartEvent`, it can be accessed as "
"`event.ctx.data[\"resumed\"]`."
msgstr "`RunStartEvent`などのコールバックからは、`event.ctx.data[\"resumed\"]`として参照できます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:106
msgid "Automatic checkpointing"
msgstr "自動チェックポイント"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:108
msgid ""
"Passing `checkpoint_path` to `run()`/`iterate()` saves automatically "
"every `checkpoint_interval` generations."
msgstr "`run()`/`iterate()`に`checkpoint_path`を渡すと、`checkpoint_interval`世代ごとに自動保存されます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`checkpoint_path` is treated as a directory rather than a single file, "
"and per-generation snapshots are created, named "
"`checkpoint_{gen:06d}.npz`."
msgstr "`checkpoint_path`は単一ファイルではなくディレクトリとして扱われ、`checkpoint_{gen:06d}.npz`という名前で世代ごとのスナップショットが作られます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:116
msgid "To resume, load the most recent snapshot in the directory."
msgstr "再開するときは、ディレクトリ内の最新のスナップショットを読み込みます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:125
msgid ""
"If you don't want to leave snapshots behind after a successful run, "
"specify `checkpoint_delete_on_success=True` (the directory itself is "
"kept; only the files inside it are deleted)."
msgstr "正常終了後にスナップショットを残したくない場合は、`checkpoint_delete_on_success=True`を指定します（ディレクトリ自体は残り、中のファイルだけが削除されます）。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:135
msgid "Saving in pickle format"
msgstr "pickle形式での保存"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:137
msgid ""
"npz saves only `ctx`, but pickle format can save the entire `Optimizer`, "
"including the fitted surrogate parameters."
msgstr "npzは`ctx`のみを保存しますが、pickle形式では学習済みのサロゲートパラメータを含めて`Optimizer`ごと保存できます。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:147
msgid "A `UserWarning` about the Python or library version may appear at runtime."
msgstr "実行時にPythonやライブラリのバージョンに関する`UserWarning`が出ることがあります。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:149
msgid ""
"An `Optimizer` containing objects that the standard `pickle` cannot "
"serialize — such as a lambda used in `Termination` — cannot be pickle-"
"saved."
msgstr "`Termination`にlambdaを使うなど、標準の`pickle`で直列化できないオブジェクトを含む`Optimizer`はpickle保存できません。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:151
msgid "Using CheckpointCallback directly"
msgstr "CheckpointCallbackを直接使う"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:153
msgid ""
"The `checkpoint_path` argument of `run()` simply registers a "
"`CheckpointCallback` internally."
msgstr "`run()`の`checkpoint_path`は、内部で`CheckpointCallback`を登録しているだけです。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:155
msgid ""
"To wire up the same behavior explicitly, register a `CheckpointCallback` "
"on `cbmanager`."
msgstr "同じ処理を明示的に組み込むには、`CheckpointCallback`を`cbmanager`に登録します。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:167
msgid ""
"The `optimizer` argument is required when specifying `format=\"pickle\"` "
"or `format=\"both\"`."
msgstr "`format=\"pickle\"`または`format=\"both\"`を指定する場合は、`optimizer`引数が必須です。"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:169
msgid "References"
msgstr "参照"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:171
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{py:class}`saealib.Optimizer`"
msgstr "{py:class}`saealib.Optimizer`"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:172
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{py:class}`saealib.CheckpointCallback`"
msgstr "{py:class}`saealib.CheckpointCallback`"

#: ../../../tutorials/checkpoint.md:173
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{py:func}`saealib.minimize`"
msgstr "{py:func}`saealib.minimize`"

